  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e2e489aa-99f2-5c58-85cb-a181a602c335" activityNameId="cf93980b-943b-5a85-b682-0c67e2547634" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, NiMH batteries</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, NiMH batteries
The multioutput-process " pyrometallurgical treatment NiMH batteries " delivers the co-products "disposal, NiMH batteries” and " Ni-Co-Fe residues, pyrometallurgical processing NiMH batteries, at plant ". The allocation is done 100% to the disposal process.;
UUID: cbf43d46-5efa-4b34-865d-3af5e1f4741f
This dataset represents the treatment of NiMH batteries from electric and electronic devices by a pyrometallurgical process.. It includes energy &amp; auxiliary consumption, waste production, emission (to air/to water) production and rough estimations of the efforts for infrastructure &amp; transportation.
Location: Data from a European recycling company - used as global average data.
Technology: Dismantling, separation of plastic covers, treatment in a static pyrolysis oven.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information &amp; own estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cbf43d46-5efa-4b34-865d-3af5e1f4741f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
